2026-11-03 18:45 Decisions (mine, maintainer asleep):
- Poll record: the Desktop sends GET /runs/claimable?owner=<window owner>. The route stores meta.last_gui_poll = {at, owner, subject} as one key/value row, so schema stays 2. An owner that is not 1-128 chars is stored as null. Recording is best-effort: a sqlite error is logged, and the list is still answered from the same store. A poll is not a claim. ctx.rest is profile-scoped, so a poll lands in the store of the profile the window shows.
- Tool: waiting_for_gui and send_waiting carry desktop_last_poll_s (null = never). The hint says never polled / polled n ago / last poll n ago, so no window seems connected; freshness is 60 s (4x POLL_MS). Fail-closed stays: nothing is started or reclaimed because of the poll age. Hints stay English.
- plugin.js: guarded host members are profileRoutes, requestProfile, retainProfile and openSession (added 2026-08-12..24 at ad2b705; navigate/notify predate them). If one is missing, the window does not poll; it shows 'Hermes Desktop zu alt für Verksted' and openSession notifies. A 404 (statusCode/status 404, or a message starting with '404' or 'Error: 404') gives 'Agent-Teil nicht aktiviert' plus the plugins.enabled hint. The chip order is waiting label, then note (clipped at 48 chars), then 'n aktiv'. The sudo comment is reworded.
- Makefile install: copies git archive HEAD:verksted. On a dirty verksted/ it prints a note that it installs HEAD without the changes; it does not refuse. A home outside .dev/ needs I_MEAN_IT=1 (realpath -m, .dev itself refused). It refuses when plugins/verksted is a link and removes <home>/desktop-plugins/verksted. It writes config.yaml only when missing; an existing one is only checked, and a note is printed if verksted is not enabled. plugin-data and 'plugins enable' are never touched. package also refuses untracked files in verksted/. test-e2e is added, not run.

